  "body": "Discover stylish, low-maintenance living in this boutique development of four stunning freehold homes, perfectly positioned with a view of Pigeon Mountain. They are built to exacting standards with premium quality throughout.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• 3 double bedrooms plus a study, including a master suite with private ensuite\r\n• 2.5 fully tiled bathrooms – sleek, modern, spacious and with floor heating\r\n• Designer kitchen with granite benchtops and quality appliances\r\n• Light-filled and spacious open-plan living and dining area\r\n• Internal-access single garage plus off-street parking\r\n• Private outdoor courtyard – ideal for relaxing or entertaining\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location:\r\nJust minutes to Highland Park Shopping , Half Moon Bay Marina and a short drive to Botany Town Centre – all your shopping, dining, and lifestyle needs are within easy reach.\r\n\r\nTop School Zones:\r\nZoned for Macleans Primary, Howick Intermediate, and Pakuranga College – a smart move for families and future resale.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a growing family, professional couple, or investor, this is a golden opportunity in a high-demand area – and with the vendor meeting the market, now is the time to act.",
